# Keep code stable across Windows/Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Frozen snapshots/locks and chunk traces use byte-level SHA-256.
# Preserve their original bytes, including existing CRLF, on every checkout.
# Validate these immutable/generated artifacts with hashes, not whitespace edits.
data/** -text -whitespace
benchmark/** -text -whitespace
results/*.jsonl -text -whitespace
# Review embeds literal chunk boundaries, including a truncated final space.
results/audit/REVIEW.md -whitespace
